<title>MEXICO: Ponderosa boosts capacity by 30,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Ponderosa boosts capacity by 30,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican boxboard company Empaques Ponderosa said in a statement Tuesday it added 30,000 tonnes of capacity for a total 180,000 tonnes capacity in its expansion earlier this month.</p>
<p>The company invested more than $50 million in the expansion, and said it installed the most modern boxboard production equipment available.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-7903))</p>
